# WPP fixture build artifacts. create_wpp_etl.ps1 has to build in this fixed
# directory, because WPP derives the trace GUID from the source file's full
# path; only wpptest.c is source, the rest is generated.
tests/fixtures/wpp_provider/*
!tests/fixtures/wpp_provider/wpptest.c
